[2J[H[1m[96mBATTLESHIP[0m  (in Malbolge Unshackled)

Malbolge has no clock and no random source, so the sea is stirred by
what you type.  Each key is folded into a generator built from
self-encrypting Malbolge code cells.  Your name places your fleet.
The enemy fleet does not exist until you fire your first shot: your
name and that shot place it, then the shot is scored against it.
After that the generator stops listening to the keyboard.

